concept:c2012a00169-sch-1-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 Dictionary"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "In this Schedule: ACNC Act means the Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission Act 2012. commencement day means the day on which this Schedule commences. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00169  Application and transitional provisions  Schedule 1 Registration  Part 2  Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission (Consequential and Transitional) Act 2012 No. 169, 2012            7" ;
    skos:definition "In this Schedule: ACNC Act means the Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission Act 2012. commencement day means the day on which this Schedule commences. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00169  Application and transitional provisions  Schedule 1 Registration  Part 2  Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission (Consequential and Transitional) Act 2012 No. 169, 2012            7"@en ;
