    cof:title "1 Dictionary" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "In this Schedule: ACNC Act means the Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission Act 2012. commencement day means the day on which this Schedule commences. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00169  Application and transitional provisions  Schedule 1 Registration  Part 2  Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission (Consequential and Transitional) Act 2012 No. 169, 2012            7" ;
