concept:c2012a00169-sch-1-sec-4c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4C Non-institution sub-entity"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-4c ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ABN of the operator is treated as being the ABN of the non-institution sub-entity. (2) If the operator was, apart from this Division, endorsed on the day before the commencement day as mentioned in paragraph 2(1)(a):  (a) the non-institution sub-entity is treated, on that day, as being endorsed in that way; and  (b) to avoid doubt, each institution sub-entity is treated, on that day, as not being endorsed in that way. Note: Item 2 applies to that non-institution sub-entity" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The ABN of the operator is treated as being the ABN of the non-institution sub-entity. (2) If the operator was, apart from this Division, endorsed on the day before the commencement day as mentioned in paragraph 2(1)(a):  (a) the non-institution sub-entity is treated, on that day, as being endorsed in that way; and  (b) to avoid doubt, each institution sub-entity is treated, on that day, as not being endorsed in that way. Note: Item 2 applies to that non-institution sub-entity"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "724fd78d2be80c4059a341c5c4cb641a48f00cf50b8f0ce11e7b772e4136b726" ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Treats operator's ABN as non-institution sub-entity's ABN." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
