concept:c2012a00169-sch-1-sec-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 The Register"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-7 ;
    values:originalText "During the period of 15 months starting on the commencement day, Division 40 of the ACNC Act does not apply to information or documents that the Commissioner does not possess. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00169  Application and transitional provisions  Schedule 1 Reporting  Part 4  Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission (Consequential and Transitional) Act 2012 No. 169, 2012            15" ;
    skos:definition "During the period of 15 months starting on the commencement day, Division 40 of the ACNC Act does not apply to information or documents that the Commissioner does not possess. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00169  Application and transitional provisions  Schedule 1 Reporting  Part 4  Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission (Consequential and Transitional) Act 2012 No. 169, 2012            15"@en ;
