concept:c2012a00169-sch-1-sec-13 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13 Meetings of the Advisory Board"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-13 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Section 145-5 of the ACNC Act applies to the 2013-14 financial year and later financial years. Meetings before 2013-14 financial year (2) The Chair may convene meetings of the Advisory Board during the period that:  (a) starts on the commencement day; and  (b) ends on 30 June 2013. (3) The ACNC Act applies to a meeting convened under subitem (2) of this item in the same way as that Act applies to meetings convened under section 145-5 of that Act. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00169  Application and transitional provisions  Schedule 1 Protected information  Part 7  Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission (Consequential and Transitional) Act 2012 No. 169, 2012            21" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Section 145-5 of the ACNC Act applies to the 2013-14 financial year and later financial years. Meetings before 2013-14 financial year (2) The Chair may convene meetings of the Advisory Board during the period that:  (a) starts on the commencement day; and  (b) ends on 30 June 2013. (3) The ACNC Act applies to a meeting convened under subitem (2) of this item in the same way as that Act applies to meetings convened under section 145-5 of that Act. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00169  Application and transitional provisions  Schedule 1 Protected information  Part 7  Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission (Consequential and Transitional) Act 2012 No. 169, 2012            21"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b8961d82e3506a8c25793a21dc44ca1f42b1e5fd8660402840d06da9259267ef" ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Conditional commencement of Advisory Board meetings" ;
