concept:c2012a00169-sch-1-sec-16-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 Review of operation of ACNC Act and this Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-16-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must cause a review to be undertaken of the first 5 years of the operation of:  (a) the ACNC Act; and  (b) this Act. (2) The persons undertaking the review must give the Minister a written report of the review within 6 months after the end of the 5 year period. (3) The Minister must cause a copy of the report of the review to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after its receipt by the Minister. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00169  Schedule 2  References to charities etc." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister must cause a review to be undertaken of the first 5 years of the operation of:  (a) the ACNC Act; and  (b) this Act. (2) The persons undertaking the review must give the Minister a written report of the review within 6 months after the end of the 5 year period. (3) The Minister must cause a copy of the report of the review to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after its receipt by the Minister. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00169  Schedule 2  References to charities etc."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b00243859974f6b3a9a42e1286391c077ccfbe95bcb591142b0a939a0662bd83" ;
