    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (b) the activities of the person’s employer in operating a public fund that:  (i) is covered by item 9.1.1 or 9.1.2 of the table in subsection 30-80(1) of the Income Tax Assessment Act 1997 (international affairs deductible gift recipients); and  (ii) meets the special conditions mentioned in that item;" ;
