concept:c2012a00169-sch-2-sec-4-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 1.7"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-4-8 ;
    values:originalText "an institution that would be a public benevolent institution, but for one or both of the following: (a) it also promotes the prevention or the control of diseases in human beings (but not as a principal activity); (b) it also promotes the prevention or the control of *behaviour that is harmful or abusive to human beings (but not as a principal activity) the institution must be a *registered charity none" ;
    skos:definition "an institution that would be a public benevolent institution, but for one or both of the following: (a) it also promotes the prevention or the control of diseases in human beings (but not as a principal activity); (b) it also promotes the prevention or the control of *behaviour that is harmful or abusive to human beings (but not as a principal activity) the institution must be a *registered charity none"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7448790f0d768fa5de73168e77e2ddc442678fdde01458e5d6eee0a2e986cc1f" ;
