    skos:prefLabel "9 1.2"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-9-3 ;
    values:originalText "a public fund established and maintained by a *registered public benevolent institution solely for providing money for the relief (including relief by way of assistance to re-establish a community) of people in a country other than: (a) Australia; and (b) a country declared by the *Foreign Affairs Minister to be a developing country; who are in distress as a result of a disaster to which subsection 30-86(1) applies none see subsection 30-86(4)" ;
