concept:c2012a00169-sch-2-sec-33 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33 Section 50-52"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-33 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the section, substitute: 50-52  Special condition for items 1.1 and 4.1  (1) An entity covered by item 1.1 or 4.1 is not exempt from income tax unless the entity is endorsed as exempt from income tax under Subdivision 50-B.  (3) This section has effect despite all the other sections of this Subdivision." ;
