concept:c2012a00169-sch-2-sec-64-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "64 Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission (Consequential and Transitional)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-64-2 ;
    values:originalText "company to omit the word “Limited” in accordance with this section. Name may be stated without “Limited”  (5) If a company:  (a) has the word “Limited” at the end of its name; but  (b) under subsection (1), is not required to do so; the word “Limited” may be omitted anywhere that the name of the company is required to be used (including on the company’s common seal). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00169  References to charities etc.  Schedule 2 Customs Tariff Act 1995  Part 6  Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission (Consequential and Transitional) Act 2012 No. 169, 2012            65" ;
    skos:definition "company to omit the word “Limited” in accordance with this section. Name may be stated without “Limited”  (5) If a company:  (a) has the word “Limited” at the end of its name; but  (b) under subsection (1), is not required to do so; the word “Limited” may be omitted anywhere that the name of the company is required to be used (including on the company’s common seal). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00169  References to charities etc.  Schedule 2 Customs Tariff Act 1995  Part 6  Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission (Consequential and Transitional) Act 2012 No. 169, 2012            65"@en ;
