concept:c2012a00169-sch-2-sec-152 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "152 Paragraph 30(1C)(f)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-152 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (f) the person:  (i) is a registered charity; or  (ii) is a government agency, partnership, educational institution, health or community service provider or other person carrying on a business or other undertaking not of a private or domestic nature, but is not a charity. Broadcasting Services Act 1992" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (f) the person:  (i) is a registered charity; or  (ii) is a government agency, partnership, educational institution, health or community service provider or other person carrying on a business or other undertaking not of a private or domestic nature, but is not a charity. Broadcasting Services Act 1992"@en ;
