concept:c2012a00169-sch-2-sec-154 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "154 Paragraph 212A(1)(a)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-154 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (a) one of the following that provides the re-transmission for the sole or principal purpose of obtaining or improving reception in a small community:  (i) an entity that is registered under the Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission Act 2012;  (ii) a not-for-profit entity that is not an ACNC type of entity; or Child Care Act 1972" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (a) one of the following that provides the re-transmission for the sole or principal purpose of obtaining or improving reception in a small community:  (i) an entity that is registered under the Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission Act 2012;  (ii) a not-for-profit entity that is not an ACNC type of entity; or Child Care Act 1972"@en ;
