doc:sch-2-sec-72-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "72 Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission (Consequential and Transitional)" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Entities that operate eligible child care centres Item Column 1 The entity is … Column 2 Charities and Not-for-profits Commission Act 2012 this item an unincorporated body that is not an ACNC type of entity the unincorporated body is: (a) not carried on for the purpose of profit or gain; and (b) approved by the Minister for the purposes of this item the Australian Capital Territory not applicable a local governing body established by or under State or Territory law not applicable" ;
    cof:pageNumber "78"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2012a00169-sch-2-sec-157 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "157 Saving of determinations and approvals"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-157 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A determination:  (a) made under paragraph 4B(1)(b) of the Child Care Act 1972; and  (b) in force just before the commencement of this item; has effect, from that commencement, as if it had been made for the purposes of paragraph 4B(b) of that Act, as amended by this Schedule. (2) An approval:  (a) made for the purposes of subparagraph 4B(1)(a)(vi) of the Child Care Act 1972; and  (b) in force just before the commencement of this item; has effect, from that commencement, as if it had been made for the purposes of items 5 and 6 of the table in section 4B of that Act, as amended by this Schedule. Classification (Publications, Films and Computer Games) Act 1995" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A determination:  (a) made under paragraph 4B(1)(b) of the Child Care Act 1972; and  (b) in force just before the commencement of this item; has effect, from that commencement, as if it had been made for the purposes of paragraph 4B(b) of that Act, as amended by this Schedule. (2) An approval:  (a) made for the purposes of subparagraph 4B(1)(a)(vi) of the Child Care Act 1972; and  (b) in force just before the commencement of this item; has effect, from that commencement, as if it had been made for the purposes of items 5 and 6 of the table in section 4B of that Act, as amended by this Schedule. Classification (Publications, Films and Computer Games) Act 1995"@en ;
