    values:originalText "Insert: registered charity means an entity that is registered under the Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission Act 2012 as the type of entity mentioned in column 1 of item 1 of the table in subsection 25-5(5) of that Act." ;
    cof:pageNumber "83"^^xsd:integer .

