concept:c2012a00169-sch-3-sec-86-ss-1c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "86(1C) Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission (Consequential and Transitional)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-86-ss-1c ;
    values:originalText "(1C) The reference in paragraph (1)(b) to *supplies that are *connected with Australia is treated as including a reference to supplies that would be connected with Australia if, for the purposes of section 9-25 of the A New Tax System (Goods and Services Tax) Act 1999, Australia included the external Territories. Corporations Act companies Taxation Administration Act 1953" ;
    skos:definition "(1C) The reference in paragraph (1)(b) to *supplies that are *connected with Australia is treated as including a reference to supplies that would be connected with Australia if, for the purposes of section 9-25 of the A New Tax System (Goods and Services Tax) Act 1999, Australia included the external Territories. Corporations Act companies Taxation Administration Act 1953"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f9c907f2bc9a353c4c41fe459028c2ad9a6dfeb6e51bf7f2e26d1ddbd6c78b0a" ;
