concept:c2012a00169-sch-3-sec-111q a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "111Q Presumptions to be made in recovery proceedings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-111q ;
    values:originalText "(1) Paragraph 588E(4)(a) and subsection 588E(5) apply to the body corporate as if the references in those provisions to subsection 286(1) were references to subsections 55-5(1) to (3) of the Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission Act 2012.  (2) Paragraph 588E(4)(b) and subsection 588E(6) apply to the body corporate as if the references in those provisions to subsection 286(2) were references to subsections 55-5(4) and (5) of the Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission Act 2012." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Paragraph 588E(4)(a) and subsection 588E(5) apply to the body corporate as if the references in those provisions to subsection 286(1) were references to subsections 55-5(1) to (3) of the Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission Act 2012.  (2) Paragraph 588E(4)(b) and subsection 588E(6) apply to the body corporate as if the references in those provisions to subsection 286(2) were references to subsections 55-5(4) and (5) of the Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission Act 2012."@en ;
